  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Heroes - Nicaragua</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project contributes to the Pathways to Prosperity programme through supporting coffee and cocoa smallholders with knowledge and skills in climate-smart agriculture and access to technologies that enable them to increase yields and diversify production through agroforestry systems which, as a whole, shield farmers from the worst climate impacts. Farmers are additionally rewarded by payments for ecosystem services and carbon markets that recognize their environmental stewardship.</narrative>
  </description>
